Globally-Unique-Address            300    ETSI-ES283.034   Grouped
Logical-Access-ID                  302    ETSI-ES283.034   OctetString ;; corrected: (ETSI-TS183.066.py#logical-access-id-row-case)
Initial-Gate-Setting-Description   303    ETSI-ES283.034   Grouped
QoS-Profile-Description            304    ETSI-ES283.034   Grouped
Physical-Access-ID                 313    ETSI-ES283.034   UTF8String
Initial-Gate-Setting-ID            314    ETSI-ES283.034   Unsigned32
QoS-Profile-ID                     315    ETSI-ES283.034   Unsigned32


